 {i:0,flat:'By seven, the street market was [[extremely busy and fully active]].',gap:'By seven, the street market was ______.',re:'in full swing',no:'in the full swing',model:'By seven, the street market was in full swing.'},
 {i:1,flat:'The museum tried to [[present the replica dishonestly as an original]].',gap:'The museum tried to ______.',re:'pass .{0,45} off as',no:'pass .{0,45} out as',model:'The museum tried to pass the replica off as an original.'},